        "id": "ZeriPassive",
        "name": "Living Battery",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Zeri's Attacks deal magic damage and are treated as Abilities. Moving and casting Burst Fire stores up energy in Zeri's Sparkpack. When fully charged her next Attack deals bonus damage.",
        "bodyHtml": "Zeri's Attacks are treated as Abilities instead of Attacks and can be charged up by moving and casting <span></span>. Uncharged Attacks consume a small amount of charge, deal <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\"> magic damage</span> and <span>execute</span> enemies below <span> Health</span>. A fully charged Attack deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\"> + max Health magic damage</span> and consumes all charge.",
