      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "ZeriW",
        "name": "Ultrashock Laser",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Zeri fires an electric pulse that slows and damages the first enemy hit. If the pulse hits a wall it expands into a long range laser.",
        "bodyHtml": "Zeri fires an electric pulse that deals <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(30/70/110/150/190 + (120% Attack Damage) + (50% Ability Power)) physical damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> the first enemy hit by 30/35/40/45/50% for 2 seconds.<br /><br />If the pulse hits terrain, it expands into a laser that applies the effects in an area and Critically Strikes champions and monsters for <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(30/70/110/150/190 + (120% Attack Damage) + (50% Ability Power)) physical damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">This Ability's cast time scales down with <span>Attack Speed</span>.<br />Empowered damage scales with Critical Strike Damage at 50% effectiveness.</span>",
